                Configcomp: /PATCHDECK/UI/DMX_Interface/dmx_fixtureprofile/stringMenu0/config
                Windowcomp: /PATCHDECK/UI/DMX_Interface/dmx_fixtureprofile/stringMenu0/popMenu/window
