            Label: /PATCHDECK/CTRL/MIDI_MAPPING_REFERENCE/2_m/label
            Numericvalue0: /PATCHDECK/CTRL/MIDI_MAPPING_REFERENCE/2_m/numericValue0
            Slider0: /PATCHDECK/CTRL/MIDI_MAPPING_REFERENCE/2_m/slider0
