      - name: Stanza
        style: Str
        label: Room
        default: unknown
        help: Room name claimed in Gaia's roomGraph (e.g. 'salotto'). Shown in Gaia's Pi Manager / device registry.
      - name: Name
        style: Str
        label: Display Name
        default: PatchDeck
        help: Human-readable device name shown in Gaia's Admin/Pi Manager.
